cmd_copy_for_ai_info#:#Copies everything an AI needs: the command language and the current board content.
cmd_ai_privacy#:#Privacy: with the board content, its texts are sent to the AI. Do not pass confidential or personal data to external AI services.
cmd_ai_preview#:#Show the text for the AI

